WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:05.345
30 Days to a better business.

00:00:05.345 --> 00:00:09.075
So I got this idea in the morning, I was having a shower.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:15.759
What if I created a free course, where I would make a video every day, with a tip,

00:00:15.759 --> 00:00:19.337
to help you guys as entrepreneurs and then be available for an hour

00:00:19.337 --> 00:00:25.233
on Twitter afterwards to answer the questions and to discuss and to help each other out?

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:28.801
So say I'm making a video, it comes out at 9 in the morning every day.

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:34.257
You watch it and then from 9 to 10 on that morning I'm there answering questions on Twitter.

00:00:34.257 --> 00:00:38.595
You can write to me whatever you have, we'll go through the material on the video

00:00:38.595 --> 00:00:42.094
and help you in that moment and give you something you can do today.

00:00:42.094 --> 00:00:47.470
"Here is your task for today to build your business", free video

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:53.104
and me for an hour after, available on Twitter answering your questions.

00:00:53.104 --> 00:00:57.768
I want to know what you think, because I would have loved that when I starting out.

00:00:57.768 --> 00:01:02.187
I would have loved that resource and opportunity, but I want to know what YOU think.

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:06.076
Because that's crazy work for me!

00:01:06.076 --> 00:01:10.481
And I'm not getting paid to do it and I'm happy if it's going to have an impact.

00:01:10.481 --> 00:01:14.525
I'm happy to do it for you guys, but you need to want it!

00:01:14.525 --> 00:01:17.600
So here's the thing, here's the test:

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:22.276
If I get 100 comments on this video from people saying that they want it,

00:01:22.276 --> 00:01:28.860
100 comments for "30 Days to a better business", with a tip every day

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.492
and me for an hour afterwards.

00:01:31.492 --> 00:01:36.941
If 100 comments are on this video, I'll do it. For free. For you guys.

00:01:36.941 --> 00:01:40.692
If we don't get the comments I'm not going to do it because you don't care enough.

00:01:40.692 --> 00:01:44.472
So let me know, leave a comment, if you like it enough enlist your friends.

00:01:44.472 --> 00:01:48.029
We'll see what happens! 30 Days to a better business!

00:01:48.029 --> 00:01:49.860
Believe!

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.000
